107
00:08:26.215 --> 00:08:27.466
Siapa namamu lagi?

108
00:08:28.467 --> 00:08:30.302
CFO Jeong-hyeon.

109
00:08:30.385 --> 00:08:34.598
Bagaimana jadinya seorang karyawan belaka
